    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Lovers Memorial</strong>: <i>Where your forever, is forever ingrained</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy, physics-based puzzle game, you guide a marble through over 80 mazes, each one nestled within an atmospheric cemetery. Every maze you solve brings new life to the resting place it guards\u2014flowers bloom from tombstones, and with a touch of humor the memory of those who\u2019ve passed is ingrained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no danger\u2014only the simple joy of solving puzzles and watching beauty grow from stillness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 Physics-Based Mazes to Solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Graphics and Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death-positive Dad Jokes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is in active development</i>, and will be adding more puzzles along the way!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I appreciate your feedback, whether it is good or bad :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Lovers Memorial</strong>: <i>Where your forever, is forever ingrained</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy, physics-based puzzle game, you guide a marble through over 80 mazes, each one nestled within an atmospheric cemetery. Every maze you solve brings new life to the resting place it guards\u2014flowers bloom from tombstones, and with a touch of humor the memory of those who\u2019ve passed is ingrained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no danger\u2014only the simple joy of solving puzzles and watching beauty grow from stillness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 Physics-Based Mazes to Solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Graphics and Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death-positive Dad Jokes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is in active development</i>, and will be adding more puzzles along the way!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I appreciate your feedback, whether it is good or bad :)</p>",
    "short_description": "\u200bGuide a marble through 80 physics-based puzzles set in an atmospheric cemetery. Each solved maze brings flowers and a dad joke to the tombstone, viewing death in a lightening and natural way. A meditative game about movement, memory, and a positive view of the acceptance of death.",
